What this licence covers, and what it does not

The text above covers this repository's own files: the adapter, the
coroutine library and the test runners under waterbox/, the build files and
the documents. It does not cover:

- patches/, which are changes to bsnes and are under bsnes's licence, the
  GNU General Public License version 3 (GPL-3.0-only);
- the aarch64 switch in waterbox/libco.c, which is ares's (ISC licence,
  waterbox/LICENSE-ares);
- extern/bsnes, bsnes v115 itself (GPL-3.0-only; its libco and nall are ISC,
  and SameBoy inside it is MIT);
- the two games in tests/roms, which are their authors' (tests/roms/README.md);
- the controller photograph in pictures/ (public domain,
  pictures/snes-controller.txt).

The package this repository builds (bsnes115.chimeraCore) contains bsnes, so
the package as a whole is distributed under the GPL version 3. Its
LICENSES.md, written into the package by the build, lists every part and
its terms.
